o borrow — the light, the colour, the composition — so the board guides decisions rather than just looking nice.","color":"sky","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null},{"id":"motiondesignmoodboard-c5","type":"note","x":56,"y":354,"w":308,"h":127,"title":"The feeling","body":"Everything moves like it is growing: slow ease-in, organic overshoot, nothing mechanical.","color":"sand","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null,"sectionId":"motiondesignmoodboard-c4"},{"id":"motiondesignmoodboard-c6","type":"note","x":56,"y":497,"w":308,"h":107,"title":"Words","body":"Organic · layered · paper-cut · hopeful · rhythmic","color":"paper","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null,"sectionId":"motiondesignmoodboard-c4"},{"id":"motiondesignmoodboard-c7","type":"note","x":56,"y":620,"w":308,"h":127,"title":"Motion principles","body":"Grow from a point. Ease in slowly, overshoot gently. Camera only moves up — towards the canopy.","color":"paper","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null,"sectionId":"motiondesignmoodboard-c4"},{"id":"motiondesignmoodboard-c8","type":"note","x":56,"y":763,"w":308,"h":107,"title":"Transitions","body":"A seed splits to become the next scene; leaves wipe across frame.","color":"paper","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null,"sectionId":"motiondesignmoodboard-c4"},{"id":"motiondesignmoodboard-c9","type":"image","x":420,"y":299,"w":560,"h":785,"title":"The final frame","body":"Photo: Looking up into a dense green forest canopy — Krishna k. sahh. CC0, via Wikimedia Commons.","color":"paper","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Looking_up_into_a_dense_green_forest_canopy.jpg","media":"@image:ph-mo-forest-canopy","filename":"ph-mo-forest-canopy.jpg","boardId":null},{"id":"motiondesignmoodboard-ca","type":"image","x":1020,"y":299,"w":270,"h":243,"title":"Scene 1: the seed","body":"Photo: Seedling in soil — Picturesque64. CC BY-SA 4.0, via Wikimedia Commons.","color":"paper","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Seedling_in_soil.jpg","media":"@image:ph-mo-seedling","filename":"ph-mo-seedling.jpg","boardId":null},{"id":"motiondesignmoodboard-cb","type":"image","x":1306,"y":299,"w":270,"h":220,"title":"Style: paper cut","body":"Photo: Gratitude tree paper leaves (15776467325) — Personal Creations. CC BY 2.0, via Wikimedia Commons.","color":"paper","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Gratitude_tree_paper_leaves_(15776467325).jpg","media":"@image:ph-mo-paper-leaves","filename":"ph-mo-paper-leaves.jpg","boardId":null},{"id":"motiondesignmoodboard-cc","type":"image","x":1592,"y":299,"w":270,"h":445,"title":"Scene 3: roots","body":"Photo: Tamarind Tree Roots Exposed Termite Mound Luangwa Jul23 A7C 05874 — This Photo was taken by Timothy A. Gonsalves . Feel free to use my photos, but please mention me as the author. I would much appreciate if you send me an email . CC BY-SA 4.0, via Wikimedia Commons.","color":"paper","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tamarind_Tree_Roots_Exposed_Termite_Mound_Luangwa_Jul23_A7C_05874.jpg","media":"@image:ph-mo-roots","filename":"ph-mo-roots.jpg","boardId":null},{"id":"motiondesignmoodboard-cd","type":"image","x":1020,"y":760,"w":270,"h":220,"title":"Light layer","body":"Photo: Mist in forest with sunbeam rays, Woods landscape (52340666528) — Jernej Furman from Slovenia. CC BY 2.0, via Wikimedia Commons.","color":"paper","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mist_in_forest_with_sunbeam_rays,_Woods_landscape_(52340666528).jpg","media":"@image:ph-mo-light-rays","filename":"ph-mo-light-rays.jpg","boardId":null},{"id":"motiondesignmoodboard-ce","type":"image","x":1306,